From fef27047bc68ac530f513b2bcc2675dc56e71800 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Pang Jiming <discrete_brain@163.com>
Date: Tue, 16 Jun 2026 14:31:09 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 02/43] feat(smap): add per-node cold page queue for swap-out

Add lockless per-node circular buffer to collect remote cold pages
whose consecutive-cold-period counter reaches SMAP_COLD_PERIOD_THRESHOLD.
Pages are enqueued during the scan path and drained during the migrate
path.

Since scan and drain are guaranteed separated in the business model,
no locking is needed on the queue.
